- Manifest V3 Chrome extension.
- No build step; plain HTML/CSS/JS.
- Runtime source of truth: background.js.
- Storage: chrome.storage.local only.
- Rules: declarativeNetRequest session rules refreshed through queueRulesUpdate().
- Tests: 152 passing across 5 Vitest files.
- Coverage gate: npm run test:coverage passes.

Core free features:

- Domain blocking.
- Schedule blocking.
- Graduated typing challenge.
- Temporary access.
- Manual override delay.
- Popup quick actions.
- Options page settings.
- Daily badge and per-site resistance counters.
- Work timer.
- Per-site time/work access conditions.
- Intention Page with per-site reminders and optional breathing.

Core Pro features:

- Strict Mode.
- Commitment Mode.
- Override cooldown.
- Behavioral friction precheck.
- Earn-access challenge timing and bonus minutes.
- Accountability presets.
- Analytics dashboard.
- Weekly report and Focus Score.

